query:
UPDATE course_lessons SET content = REPLACE(content,
  'rFlex 525 control board, there is a small jumper (J2) located near the analog input terminals. **You must physically move this jumper from the "0-10V" position to the "4-20mA" position.** If you forget this step, the drive will not read the current signal correctly.',
  'rFlex 525 uses **dedicated terminals** for each analog input type — Terminal 13 for 0-10V voltage input, and Terminal 15 for 4-20mA current input. **There is no physical jumper to change.** Simply wire to the correct terminal and set parameter **P047 [Anlg In Config]** to match your signal type (0 = 0-10V on Terminal 13, 1 = 4-20mA on Terminal 15).'
) WHERE id = 30021;

